    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$2.23 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for a full plate of chicken lo mein. The same order at a Chinese takeout spot runs $11 to $14 before tip and delivery fees, so this batch pays for itself by the second container.",
